          {
            "text": "Performed through the same arthroscopic portals as the rotator cuff repair, same operative session (ADR-0121) — not a separate skin incision. Point tenderness over the AC joint on pre-op exam, together with the mild osteoarthritic changes on the 2024-01-22 MRI, supported concomitant treatment rather than leaving it unaddressed."
          }
